#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-boursorama.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://boursorama."
"com/bourse/\">Boursorama</a>.<br/>Then, enter the symbol of the expected "
"quotes."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://boursorama.com/bourse/\">Boursorama</a>.<br/>Zatim unesite simbol željene kotacije."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-coinmarketcap.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://"
"coinmarketcap.com\">CoinMarketCap</a>.<br/><br/>Then, you must create an "
"account to get an API key and set it in setting.<br/>Then, enter the "
"expected quote in expected currency. Example: if you want BTC in USD, you "
"must enter BTC-USD."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com\">CoinMarketCap</a>.<br/><br/>Zatim izradite račun da biste dobili API ključ i postavite ga u postavkama.<br/>Nakon toga unesite željenu kotaciju u željenoj valuti. Primjerice, ako želite BTC u USD-u, unesite BTC-USD."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-cryptocompare.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://www."
"cryptocompare.com/\">CryptoCompare</a>.<br/>Then, you must create an account "
"to get an API key and set it in setting.<br/>Then, enter the <expected "
"quote>-<in the expected currency>. Example: if you want BTC in USD, you must "
"enter BTC-USD."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://www.cryptocompare.com/\">CryptoCompare</a>.<br/>Zatim izradite račun da biste dobili API ključ i postavite ga u postavkama.<br/>Nakon toga unesite <expected quote>-<in the expected currency>. Primjerice, ako želite BTC u USD-u, unesite BTC-USD."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-exchangeratesapi.io.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"[DEPRECATED: Prefer exchangerates_apilayer.com]. You can get the list of "
"available quotes from <a href=\"https://exchangeratesapi.io/"
"\">exchangeratesapi.io</a>.<br/><br/>Then, you must create an account to get "
"an API key and set it in setting.<br/>Then, enter the expected quote in "
"expected currency. Example: if you want BTC in USD, you must enter BTC-USD."
msgstr "[ZASTARJELO: umjesto toga upotrijebite exchangerates_apilayer.com]. Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://exchangeratesapi.io/\">exchangeratesapi.io</a>.<br/><br/>Zatim izradite račun da biste dobili API ključ i postavite ga u postavkama.<br/>Nakon toga unesite željenu kotaciju u željenoj valuti. Primjerice, ako želite BTC u USD-u, unesite BTC-USD."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-exchangerates_apilayer.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://"
"exchangeratesapi.io/\">exchangeratesapi.io</a>.<br/><br/>Then, you must "
"create an account on <a href=\"https://apilayer.com\">https://apilayer.com</"
"a> to get an API key and set it in setting.<br/>Then, enter the expected "
"quote in expected currency. Example: if you want BTC in USD, you must enter "
"BTC-USD."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://exchangeratesapi.io/\">exchangeratesapi.io</a>.<br/><br/>Zatim izradite račun na <a href=\"https://apilayer.com\">https://apilayer.com</a> da biste dobili API ključ i postavite ga u postavkama.<br/>Nakon toga unesite željenu kotaciju u željenoj valuti. Primjerice, ako želite BTC u USD-u, unesite BTC-USD."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-grandtrunk.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of supported currencies from <a href=\"https://"
"currencies.apps.grandtrunk.net/currencies\">here</a>.<br/>Then, enter the "
"expected currency."
msgstr "Popis podržanih valuta možete pronaći <a href=\"https://currencies.apps.grandtrunk.net/currencies\">ovdje</a>.<br/>Zatim unesite željenu valutu."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-skrooge.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can find the list of available quotes <a href=\"https://skrooge.org/data"
"\">here</a>.<br/>Don't put the csv extension.<br/>In some case (eg. "
"inflation), you will have to remove already downloaded values to download "
"them again."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći <a href=\"https://skrooge.org/data\">ovdje</a>.<br/>Nemojte navoditi nastavak csv.<br/>U nekim ćete slučajevima (npr. inflacija) morati ukloniti već preuzete vrijednosti kako biste ih ponovno preuzeli."

#: skgbankmodeler/sources/org.kde.skrooge-source-stooq.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://stooq.pl"
"\">Stooq</a>.<br/>Then, enter the symbol of the expected quotes."
msgstr "Popis dostupnih kotacija možete pronaći na stranici <a href=\"https://stooq.pl\">Stooq</a>.<br/>Zatim unesite simbol željene kotacije."

